   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where you from",
   "texto": [
    "**Откуда вы?** = Where are you from? (from you: **Откуда ты?**).",
    "It is answered with **из** (de) and the name changes to **genitivo**: Испания → **из Испании**, Россия → **из России**, Москва → **из Москвы**, Мадрид → **из Мадрида**.",
    "As a first pattern, many feminine names in **-а/-я** end up in **-ы/-и**; the **-ия** names end up in **-ии**. There are other patterns and exceptions that you will learn with examples."
   ]
  },
